        "content": "<p>Thanks! I indeed get the whole AST. But the tree looks scary <span aria-label=\"innocent\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f607\" role=\"img\" title=\"innocent\">:innocent:</span> I'll try finding the simplest way to achieve my goal.</p>",
